<title>UK: Wet Brent trades down at Aug -3 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades down at Aug -3 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude changed hands on Friday at a three cent discount to August Brent, traders said.</p>
<p>The July 23-25 loader was valued 13 cents lower than the level established on Thursday for a July 24-26 loader exchanged by two majors and for a July 21-23 loader done on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
